      "role": "user",
      "content": "that's a good start. could you maybe add a bit more detail on the wrist/hand stuff? like specific ways to position the keyboard or mouse so people don't get carpal tunnel or those annoying little aches in their joints? maybe include a section on \"micro-breaks\" too.",
